WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.149 --> 00:00:01.149
All right.

00:00:01.149 --> 00:00:04.550
Many people who want to get on with me today,
I want to hear from some of them.

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:09.440
Let's go first here to Marta from Miami, Florida.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.849
Marta, what is on your mind today?

00:00:11.849 --> 00:00:12.849
Hello.

00:00:12.849 --> 00:00:13.849
Hello.

00:00:13.849 --> 00:00:15.449
Yes, I can.

00:00:15.449 --> 00:00:16.449
Oh.

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:18.320
Well, what about.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:20.790
I live in Miami, Florida.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:21.790
Most.

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:22.790
Martha, you're cutting in and out.

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:25.130
All right, so so we you're I can barely hear
you.

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:28.470
I heard you live in Miami and then you immediately
cut out.

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:32.820
So most of my family's Cuban-American and
they keep using the argument that Biden is

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:35.770
a communist and he's a socialist.

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:39.150
And I just want to know, what can I say to
them or do you have, like, a good article

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:41.700
you can recommend just so I can like you?

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:42.700
But the argument.

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:49.420
Listen, I have not seen anybody seriously
be able to answer the question, which Biden

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.590
policy is a socialist policy.

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:57.330
So I'd be curious if you were to say, OK,
let's let's actually examine that.

00:00:57.330 --> 00:01:00.740
What Biden policy is a socialist policy.

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:04.670
Usually that falls apart and then they move
on to a different argument, which maybe would

00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:06.530
be easier to deal with.

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:10.101
Yeah, because I tell them I'm like, you know,
it's not it's going to be like that.

00:01:10.101 --> 00:01:14.170
I don't know, it's gonna be like Cuba and
we're gonna be, you know, struggling for food.

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:17.850
Secondly, I like listen, I mean, what did
I say to them?

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:21.250
Was it like Cuba when Barack Obama was president
for eight years?

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:23.200
Because Joe Biden was the vice president.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:26.670
If it wasn't like Cuba during those eight
years, why would it be like that under Joe

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:28.190
Biden?

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:29.710
Yes.

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:32.550
And then they bring up, you know, the whole
Cuban missile crisis.

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:36.010
And Kennedy and it's just what I don't know
what to do with Joe Biden.

00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:37.010
What?

00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:40.610
You know, I think in a lot of these here,
what you're getting to, Marta, is that in

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:46.530
a lot of these situations, it's not really
about you explaining the truth.

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:52.890
It's about just coming up with something to
say so they can perpetuate their own misunderstandings.

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:54.880
And you might I mean, it could go that way.

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:57.200
It could go Biden's a socialist.

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:59.230
And you say, well, what's one socialist policy?

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:02.549
They say, well, it's just it's going to become
like Cuba.

00:02:02.549 --> 00:02:06.240
And then you would say, well, was it like
Cuba when Obama was president?

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:09.259
And then they would say, yeah, but look at
what Kennedy did during the Cuban missile

00:02:09.259 --> 00:02:10.259
crisis.

00:02:10.259 --> 00:02:12.290
Now we're 50 years ago, right?

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:14.959
It's they don't really want to know anything.

00:02:14.959 --> 00:02:17.439
And sometimes you have to just acknowledge
that.

00:02:17.439 --> 00:02:22.040
Yeah, that's basically been the exact argument
for months and months and months, is that

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:23.489
I don't envy you, Marta.

00:02:23.489 --> 00:02:28.920
And, you know, the people who are calling
in and may not know the American Hispanic

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:33.760
community is a very left wing community in
total.

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:38.980
But the most conservative subsection of Latin
Americans is Cuban-Americans.

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:44.530
And it is usually this reflexive anti Castro
thing that the ones who came to the U.S. were

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:46.529
against the Castro regime.

00:02:46.529 --> 00:02:48.959
They associate the Castro regime with Democrats.

00:02:48.959 --> 00:02:49.959
Why?

00:02:49.959 --> 00:02:50.959
I don't know.

00:02:50.959 --> 00:02:53.139
And you end up in situations like Martha's
situation.

00:02:53.139 --> 00:02:55.499
OK, thank you very much.

00:02:55.499 --> 00:02:58.069
All right, great to hear from you, Martha.

00:02:58.069 --> 00:04:50.020
Appreciate appreciate 

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:57.479
the call.

